{"version":1,"content":"<p>有關蘋果20周年紀念版iPhone的消息持續浮出水面。最新爆料顯示，計劃於2027年推出的iPhone 20 Pro可能會採用一款全新的主攝像頭傳感器，其邏輯電路部分將首次使用17納米工藝製造，這一變化有望為影像性能帶來顯著提升。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586640.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T12:38:17.946494+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T12:26:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T12:31:08.909697+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:31:08.909697+00:00","content_hash":"2f66695c4f5b15bed6d232251d64c2a90b30c9a016d7f456f4043a5a15fa9da7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}